cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GlidieBirdie: A Zero-Dependency, Fixed-Step 720 Hz Deterministic Browser Game Architecture with Procedural Web Audio, WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility, and Lean 4 Verification"
message: "If you cite or build upon GlidieBirdie's deterministic browser architecture, test harness, or Lean 4 formalization, please cite this metadata."
type: software
version: "3.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/0thernes/glidiebirdie"
url: "https://0thernes.github.io/glidiebirdie/"
abstract: >-
  Zero-runtime-dependency, no-bundler browser flyer built in 18 native ES2022 modules
  on an exact 720 Hz fixed-step tick grid, paired with procedural Web Audio, WCAG 2.2 AA
  accessibility, 45 zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 formal theorems (Palomar Challenge/Solution),
  10/10 surgical mutation testing, and an AMS-LaTeX Build White Paper. Developed with AI
  engineering assistance under human direction; not peer reviewed.
